/*!

*\page interruptin InterruptIn
*
* This instruction is used to create an interrupin GPIO. Associated function must be defined before defining the interrupin. <br>
* Keep in mind that interrupt function should not take a lot of time to execute it.
*
*<span style='color:blue'><em><H4> Syntax: </H4></em></span>
* <strong>interrupin PINNAME, FunctionName </strong> <br>
*    or<br>
*<strong>interrupin PINNAME  FunctionName </strong><br>
*/
